{
 "about": "P02 guest mobile: the 17 screens that are views in the client's Mobile App v4 (29 September build). Captured 30 September with tools/capture-prototype.mjs. Every screen opens Summit Peaks with the decided tab bar (Home, Explore, Buy tickets, Plan, Tickets; the Map tab is optional in v4, so At the Venue opens from Home). Union Arena is used for the seat map.",
